  "term": "competency-based instruction",
  "definition": "Competency-based instruction is a teaching approach that emphasizes developing learners’ practical abilities for responsible, engaged use of a tool or skill, rather than relying mainly on prohibitions. In this source, it refers to ethics teaching in AI-assisted translation that builds ethical literacy and critical use habits.",
